---
import "../styles/global.css";
import Nav from "../components/nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/footer.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/7.0.1/css/all.min.css"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
    />
    <title>About Me | Patrick's Website</title>
  </head>
  <body class="scroll-smooth">
    <Nav />
    <main id="about">
      <section class="about-section">
        <h2>About Me</h2>
        <p>
          I’m a developer passionate about creating accessible, well-crafted
          projects that blend clever design with robust engineering. I enjoy
          building experiences that are both visually appealing and technically
          sound, ensuring every detail contributes to a polished final product.
        </p>
        <p>
          Currently, I work as a freelance full-stack developer, designing,
          building, and refining applications with a strong emphasis on
          accessibility, performance, and usability. I strive to deliver
          software that not only functions flawlessly but also provides a
          satisfying experience for every user.
        </p>
        <p>
          In the past, I’ve developed software primarily for start-ups and as a
          freelance developer, collaborating closely with small teams to
          transform innovative ideas into reality. Beyond coding, I take
          pleasure in mentoring, guiding learners, and providing support to
          fellow developers whenever needed, helping others grow alongside me.
        </p>
        <p>
          In my spare time, I enjoy gaming while balancing coding projects and
          community involvement. Staying actively engaged allows me to further
          meaningful connections, contribute across multiple communities, and
          continuously learn from others in both tech and gaming spaces.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="resume-section">
        <h2>Resume PDF</h2>
        <p>A shortened PDF version of my resume can be downloaded below ↓</p>
        <div class="resume-button">
          <a href="your-resume.pdf" target="_blank" class="btn">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i> Download Resume
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
  <Footer />
</html>
